{"id":"846676177c8a9727","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-local-reflection.md","title":"逐句局部反射模式","display":"df-local-reflection — 逐句局部反射模式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-local-reflection","aliases":["91-df-local-reflection","91-df-RFN-local"],"display":"df-local-reflection — 逐句局部反射模式","depends_on":["[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-local-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-local-reflection</span><span>91-df-RFN-local</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-reflection — 逐句局部反射模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为可递归公理化的算术理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_S\">\\(\\mathcal L_S\\)</span> 为其语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prov}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Prov}_S\\)</span> 为标准证明谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\)</span> 为下述模式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{loc}\">\\(\\mathrm{loc}\\)</span> 表示每个标准句子一个实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>没有在对象语言中量化句子。矛盾句实例给出一致性；但局部反射模式一般强于这一个实例。\n全局反射须配合相应 T-out 才推出这些局部实例，不能在任意无约束 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 上写无条件的强度比较。Löb 定理说明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的证明谓词满足相应推导条件且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 证明某个自己的局部反射实例，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 已证明该实例的结论句。</p>\n<p>来源：§22.1，印刷页 308–309。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{loc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1316,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-local-reflection]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-local-reflection]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fix